  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_6303.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El Local de Asociaciones de La Safona ha acogido la tarde-noche de este lunes el sorteo de los siete premios de la campa&ntilde;a de San Valent&iacute;n de Onda Centre Comercia (OCC)l: dos viajes para dos personas de fin de semana al hotel con spa Oliva Golf y mariscada, y cinco cenas rom&aacute;nticas tambi&eacute;n para dos personas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_6318.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Los premios se entregar&aacute;n este jueves, 19 de febrero, a las 20.30 horas en el sal&oacute;n de actos del Centro de Empleo y Cultura. Han dirigido el sorteo el presidente de OCC, Jos&eacute; Ernesto Talamantes Mar&iacute;n, y el secretario adjunto, Ram&oacute;n Jord&aacute;n Cameselle. Ha extraido las siete papeletas, m&aacute;s dos de reserva, &Aacute;lex Talamantes Chaparro.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6300.jpg\" alt=\"img_6300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6302.jpg\" alt=\"img_6302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6303.jpg\" alt=\"img_6303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6305.jpg\" alt=\"img_6305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6307.jpg\" alt=\"img_6307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6308.jpg\" alt=\"img_6308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6310.jpg\" alt=\"img_6310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6312.jpg\" alt=\"img_6312\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6313.jpg\" alt=\"img_6313\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6314.jpg\" alt=\"img_6314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6317.jpg\" alt=\"img_6317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigoccsantvalenti15/img_6318.jpg\" alt=\"img_6318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
